  "solution": "Giả sử <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> có vectơ chỉ phương <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math> có vectơ chỉ phương <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có <div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><msub><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><